---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../components/CTABlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Work — Heurystics"
  description="Measurable outcomes from production AI systems. 20% revenue lift, 650 customers on autonomous operations, 1.83x return on ad spend."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <h1 class="fade-up">Three times we turned operational complexity into measurable business results.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Case 1 -->
  <section class="section case-section" id="case-1">
    <div class="container case-grid">
      <div class="case-visual fade-up">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" fill="none" class="case-svg">
          <!-- Stacked platform layers -->
          <rect x="40" y="220" width="320" height="40" rx="3" fill="#1B2A4A" opacity="0.9"/>
          <text x="200" y="245" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="12" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">POS System</text>
          <rect x="40" y="170" width="320" height="40" rx="3" fill="#1B2A4A" opacity="0.75"/>
          <text x="200" y="195" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="12" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">Inventory Management</text>
          <rect x="40" y="120" width="320" height="40" rx="3" fill="#1B2A4A" opacity="0.6"/>
          <text x="200" y="145" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="12" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">Operations Management</text>
          <rect x="40" y="70" width="320" height="40" rx="3" fill="#1B2A4A" opacity="0.45"/>
          <text x="200" y="95" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="12" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">Loyalty Engine</text>
          <rect x="40" y="20" width="320" height="40" rx="3" fill="#B5862A" opacity="0.85"/>
          <text x="200" y="45" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="12" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-weight="500">AI Recommendation Layer</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="case-text fade-up delay-1">
        <span class="eyebrow">RETAIL OPERATIONS &middot; 10 LOCATIONS &middot; REGULATED INDUSTRY</span>
        <h3>Customers spent 20% more per visit. Wait times dropped 30%. Satisfaction up 25%.</h3>
        <p>A 10-location retail chain operating in one of the most heavily regulated industries in the US needed a unified operational platform. Not a feature. Not an add-on. The entire system.</p>
        <p>We built it. Point-of-sale. Operations management. Inventory tracking across all locations. Loyalty and rewards programs. Mobile applications for customers. And then we layered AI on top — a recommendation engine trained on real customer behavior that suggests the right products at the right moment, at the point of purchase.</p>
        <p>This wasn't a pilot that sat on a staging server. This ran in production, across 10 physical stores, handling real transactions, real inventory, real customers every day.</p>
        <div class="case-results">
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">10</span><span>locations — full production deployment</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">20%</span><span>increase in AOV via AI recommendations</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">30%</span><span>reduction in customer wait times</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">25%</span><span>improvement in satisfaction scores</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="case-why"><em>Multi-location operations. Compliance complexity. Inventory management. This is the same pattern — take a high-volume, error-prone operational workflow and make it run itself. Exactly what we do for real estate companies.</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Case 2 -->
  <section class="section case-section" id="case-2">
    <div class="container case-grid case-grid-reverse">
      <div class="case-text fade-up">
        <span class="eyebrow">CONTENT OPERATIONS &middot; 650 CUSTOMERS &middot; 4-6 HRS SAVED PER TASK</span>
        <h3>650 customers stopped doing 4–6 hours of manual work per task. In four months.</h3>
        <p>A startup needed to automate content operations at scale — research, creation, editing, publishing — across multiple languages and platforms. Manual process: 4-6 hours per piece. Budget ceiling: under 30 cents per published article.</p>
        <p>We designed a 5-agent autonomous system:</p>
        <p><strong>Agent 1</strong> — Researches the company through their URL, builds a vectorized knowledge base.<br>
        <strong>Agent 2</strong> — Scrapes competition, analyzes trends, scores topics for SEO penetration via SERP and DataForSEO APIs.<br>
        <strong>Agent 3</strong> — Writes content outlines, then full articles tuned to user parameters.<br>
        <strong>Agent 4</strong> — Reviews quality, refines copy, sources stock photography via API.<br>
        <strong>Agent 5</strong> — Schedules optimal publishing times, auto-posts to WordPress, Shopify, Wix, or LinkedIn.</p>
        <p>No human in the loop for routine operations.</p>
        <div class="case-results">
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">5</span><span>agents — fully autonomous pipeline</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">650</span><span>customers in 4 months</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">3,000+</span><span>workflows executed</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">50</span><span>real estate companies</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-visual fade-up delay-1">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 200" fill="none" class="case-svg">
          <!-- Pipeline flow -->
          <circle cx="50" cy="100" r="28" fill="#1B2A4A"/>
          <text x="50" y="105" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">Research</text>
          <line x1="80" y1="100" x2="120" y2="100" stroke="#C4BDAF" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
          <circle cx="150" cy="100" r="28" fill="#1B2A4A"/>
          <text x="150" y="105" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">Analyze</text>
          <line x1="180" y1="100" x2="220" y2="100" stroke="#C4BDAF" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
          <circle cx="250" cy="100" r="28" fill="#1B2A4A"/>
          <text x="250" y="105" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">Create</text>
          <line x1="280" y1="100" x2="320" y2="100" stroke="#C4BDAF" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
          <circle cx="350" cy="100" r="28" fill="#B5862A"/>
          <text x="350" y="105" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">Publish</text>
          <!-- Animated dots -->
          <circle r="4" fill="#B5862A" opacity="0.8">
            <animateMotion dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M50,100 L150,100 L250,100 L350,100"/>
          </circle>
          <circle r="4" fill="#B5862A" opacity="0.5">
            <animateMotion dur="3s" begin="1s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M50,100 L150,100 L250,100 L350,100"/>
          </circle>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Case 3 -->
  <section class="section case-section" id="case-3">
    <div class="container case-grid">
      <div class="case-visual fade-up">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 250" fill="none" class="case-svg">
          <!-- Bar chart -->
          <rect x="100" y="80" width="80" height="140" rx="3" fill="#C4BDAF"/>
          <text x="140" y="230" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6B6860" font-size="11" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">1x</text>
          <text x="140" y="250" text-anchor="middle" fill="#C4BDAF" font-size="9" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif">Baseline</text>
          <rect x="220" y="30" width="80" height="190" rx="3" fill="#B5862A"/>
          <text x="260" y="230" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6B6860" font-size="11" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace">1.83x</text>
          <text x="260" y="250" text-anchor="middle" fill="#B5862A" font-size="9" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif">After</text>
          <!-- Label -->
          <text x="200" y="20" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1B2A4A" font-size="10" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" opacity="0.5">RETURN ON AD SPEND</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="case-text fade-up delay-1">
        <span class="eyebrow">MARKETING OPTIMIZATION &middot; $1.5B MANUFACTURER &middot; 83% MORE REVENUE</span>
        <h3>Same budget. 83% more revenue. The channels that were burning money stopped burning money.</h3>
        <p>A $1.5 billion US electronics manufacturer needed to understand which of their digital advertising channels were actually driving revenue — and which were burning money. Annual media spend: $5 million across multiple paid channels and six product categories with 10,000+ SKUs.</p>
        <p>We built a marketing mix model from scratch. Feature engineering for holidays, seasonality, and trend effects. Ad stock transformation to capture media exposure carryover. Saturation modeling to identify diminishing returns.</p>
        <p>The model revealed clear reallocation opportunities across channels, resulting in a 1.83x lift in return on ad spend without increasing the total budget.</p>
        <div class="case-results">
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">1.83x</span><span>ROAS lift</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">$5M</span><span>media budget optimized</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">10K+</span><span>SKUs across 6 categories</span></div>
          <div class="case-stat"><span class="stat-number">COVID-adjusted</span><span>model</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABlock />

</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .case-section { padding: 72px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--limestone); }
  .case-section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

  .case-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
  .case-grid-reverse { direction: rtl; }
  .case-grid-reverse > * { direction: ltr; }

  .case-visual { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .case-svg { width: 100%; max-width: 400px; background: var(--parchment); border: 1px solid var(--limestone); border-radius: 3px; padding: 20px; }

  .case-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .case-text h3 { margin-top: 8px; }
  .case-text p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--driftwood); line-height: 1.7; }
  .case-text strong { color: var(--navy); }

  .case-results { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin: 16px 0; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--limestone); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--limestone); }
  .case-stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .case-stat .stat-number { font-size: 20px; color: var(--ochre); }
  .case-stat span:last-child { font-size: 12px; color: var(--driftwood); }

  .case-why { font-size: 14px; color: var(--sandstone); }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .case-grid, .case-grid-reverse { grid-template-columns: 1fr; direction: ltr; }
    .case-results { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .case-results { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
